# Lean-Agile MVP workspace. project.json IS tracked: being a marked project is a fact about the
# repo and should survive a clone. Everything else under .mvp/ is local app state (mutated by
# every mvp query, not just writes) and must stay machine-local.
.mvp/*
!.mvp/project.json